Error>>,
}

/// A single-threaded engine that processes requests one at a time.
pub struct LocalEngine {
    shared: Arc<Shared>,
    tx: Sender<GenRequest>,
    rx: Mutex<Receiver<GenEvent>>,
}

impl LocalEngine {
    pub fn new(model: Model, codec: Arc<dyn TextCodec>, meta: EngineMeta) -> Self {
        let (tx, rx) = channel();
        let (tx2, rx2) = channel();
        let shared = Arc::new(Shared {
            inner: Mutex::new(Inner { model, state: SequenceState::default() }),
            telemetry: Arc::new(Telemetry::default()),
            codec,
            eos: meta.eos_ids,
            failed: Mutex::new(None),
        });
        let worker = Worker { tx: tx2, shared: shared.clone() };
        std::thread::Builder::new().name("intarsia-worker".into()).spawn(move || worker.run(rx)).expect("spawn worker");
        LocalEngine { shared, tx, rx: Mutex::new(rx2) }
    }
}

